<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - RadiSys raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - RadiSys raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said it raised its rating on RadiSys Corp to neutral from underperform.</p>
<p>-- cited stock price.</p>
<p>-- raised 1997 earnings estimate to $1.55 per share from $1.50, citing slightly lower expenses.</p>
<p>-- shares ended up 2-1/2 to 37-1/2 Thursday.</p>
</text>
